 upward** — FY27 AUM \"on course to achieve INR50,000 crores\" (vs an earlier INR 47,000 cr target) and a new **INR 65,000 cr FY28 target at 30%+ CAGR** — while committing to a **400-branch build completed \"on or before December 2026.\"** The two things to hold against that: gold's Stage-2 pool jumped INR 373 cr on a 4% QoQ gold-price decline (total Stage 2 ratio 2.8% → 3.8%), and co-lending — 20% of AUM and a pillar of the capital-efficient story — stalled to +4% QoQ with income *down 8% YoY* as the new co-lending guidelines force partner banks onto CLM1.","trig":[]},"lm":"","m":24665,"mem":0,"pdd":"","prev_stage":null,"prev_zone_vpe":null,"r":null,"s":"CGCL","sig":"","sx":{"SMA_50":"234.5","base_count":"","drawdown_from_prev_signal":"","duration_from_prev_signal":"","pct_below_52w_high":"3.0","pct_change_from_prev_signal":"","pivot_close":"","pivot_low":"","stage_changed_since_prev_signal":"","vpe_df_60d_sum":"0.0","vpe_zone_cumul_df":""},"t":""}},"s":"CGCL"}